From 723b0d6c1a28214570495ce6a1d94ce560b95a7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:07:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(post): add qualified iTNC 530 Klartext milling
 output

Use the Picomax installation and exact NC software to select the initial metric XYZ dialect. Refuse unsupported records and engine warnings before writing NC output.

Refs #3098

Fixes #3182
